secubox-grafana (1.0.3-1~bookworm1) bookworm; urgency=medium

  * install-lxc.sh: seed /etc/resolv.conf via lxc-attach (the LXC is
    unprivileged — rootfs is owned by mapped uid 100000, host root cannot
    redirect to a file in there directly). Move call AFTER lxc-start.

